WEBVTT

00:00:54.848 --> 00:00:56.558
Work it, Dracula.

00:00:57.226 --> 00:00:58.477
You know it.

00:01:00.604 --> 00:01:02.189
Lookin' good, Drac!

00:01:02.272 --> 00:01:03.649
Feeling good, Frank.

00:01:03.732 --> 00:01:06.109
Look at you, so fancy!

00:01:06.193 --> 00:01:07.819
What? This? Please.

00:01:08.320 --> 00:01:10.030
Dressed to impress, huh?

00:01:10.113 --> 00:01:11.365
"Impress"?

00:01:11.448 --> 00:01:13.158
Who do I need to impress?

00:01:13.742 --> 00:01:15.118
Isn't that Captain Ericka?

00:01:15.327 --> 00:01:16.453
Oh, no!

00:01:17.329 --> 00:01:18.413
What?

00:01:19.039 --> 00:01:20.457
No, not her.

00:01:21.708 --> 00:01:22.709
That's good!

00:01:23.669 --> 00:01:24.836
Very amusing.

00:01:34.054 --> 00:01:37.099
Sorry, Drac. You know, it's just
we've never seen you like this.

00:01:37.182 --> 00:01:38.267
I know.

00:01:38.350 --> 00:01:39.518
It doesn't make any sense.

00:01:39.601 --> 00:01:42.437
You can't Zing twice, it's impossible!

00:01:42.521 --> 00:01:44.815
But I did! So now what?

00:01:45.607 --> 00:01:47.192
And what about Mavis?

00:01:47.568 --> 00:01:49.570
She wants you to be happy, right?

00:01:49.653 --> 00:01:52.281
I'm sure she'll go with the flow.

00:01:52.531 --> 00:01:54.032
No, no, no!

00:01:54.116 --> 00:01:56.618
Mavis needs me. She depends on me.

00:01:56.702 --> 00:01:59.705
I need to be home with my family.

00:01:59.788 --> 00:02:03.834
Murray here may be from Egypt,
but you're the one in

00:02:03.917 --> 00:02:05.252
"da Nile."

00:02:06.962 --> 00:02:08.088
You guys get that?

00:02:08.755 --> 00:02:09.798
You hit me right in the...

00:02:09.881 --> 00:02:10.882
Mavis!

00:02:14.553 --> 00:02:16.888
Don't say a word,
or I'll haunt your dreams.

00:02:18.390 --> 00:02:19.391
Having fun?

00:02:19.474 --> 00:02:22.311
I'm having even more fun
now that you're here.

00:02:22.561 --> 00:02:26.607
You know, Dad, I feel really lucky
to have this time with you.

00:02:26.690 --> 00:02:29.443
All of us together, it's really special.

00:02:29.568 --> 00:02:31.820
Me, too, spider monkey.

00:02:32.446 --> 00:02:35.824
Now, are you ready for me
to destroy you in monster ball?

00:02:36.908 --> 00:02:38.410
Monster ball!

00:02:38.493 --> 00:02:39.620
Come on, Papa Drac!

00:02:40.370 --> 00:02:41.371
Bring it on!

00:02:41.455 --> 00:02:43.957
For I am king of family fun!

00:02:47.836 --> 00:02:50.339
All right! Who is ready to get pummeled?

00:02:51.923 --> 00:02:52.966
I got to warn you,

00:02:53.050 --> 00:02:56.887
I played second-team coed intramural
volleyball at Santa Cruz.

00:02:58.055 --> 00:02:59.723
Sure, pal. Whatever you say.

00:02:59.806 --> 00:03:02.517
Everybody, just please watch the hair.

00:03:02.601 --> 00:03:04.227
Watch the hair!

00:03:05.103 --> 00:03:06.813
Let's go! Let's do this!

00:03:06.897 --> 00:03:09.149
Oh, my gosh,
this is gonna be so much fun.

00:03:09.232 --> 00:03:10.317
Get ready.

00:03:10.692 --> 00:03:12.194
Here comes the pain!

00:03:15.947 --> 00:03:18.533
-Spike!
-Not the hair!

00:03:22.371 --> 00:03:24.331
No, no, no!

00:03:26.166 --> 00:03:27.334
All right!

00:03:28.835 --> 00:03:31.963
Captain Ericka, you are needed on deck.

00:03:32.047 --> 00:03:34.466
Next stop... Buh-bye, Dracula.

00:03:35.717 --> 00:03:36.968
All right, baby!

00:03:59.116 --> 00:04:00.575
Oh, baby, I got this.

00:04:00.659 --> 00:04:01.952
Hey there, monsters.

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:07.791
Yeah! What'd I say!

00:04:10.711 --> 00:04:12.879
We're arriving at our first destination.

00:04:18.427 --> 00:04:20.887
The underwater volcano!

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:25.726
Everyone, grab your scuba gear
and get ready to explore

00:04:25.809 --> 00:04:28.061
the wonders of the sea.

00:04:28.854 --> 00:04:30.397
Especially you,

00:04:30.814 --> 00:04:32.274
Count Dracula.

00:04:36.445 --> 00:04:38.155
You see that, pal? She likes you.

00:04:38.238 --> 00:04:39.614
No, no, no.

00:04:39.698 --> 00:04:41.700
That sounds like a Zing in full effect.

00:04:41.783 --> 00:04:43.577
No, no, no.

00:04:43.660 --> 00:04:45.203
Yes, yes, yes.

00:04:45.287 --> 00:04:47.998
I'm just here to have family fun.

00:04:48.081 --> 00:04:50.208
Family, family, fun, fun.

00:05:12.481 --> 00:05:14.274
Let's see. What about here?

00:05:34.961 --> 00:05:36.963
Right this way, everyone.

00:05:49.059 --> 00:05:52.938
Welcome to one of the true wonders
of the underwater kingdom.

00:05:53.021 --> 00:05:55.690
I give you Volcano del Fuego.

00:05:56.441 --> 00:05:58.735
Or, as the local sea life call it...

00:07:55.518 --> 00:07:56.645
What a cute family.

00:07:56.728 --> 00:07:57.729
What? No, it's not.

00:07:58.188 --> 00:07:59.439
Dracula bad!

